---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="隐私说明" description="Codex Venture 如何使用站点统计和浏览器本地设置。How Codex Venture uses site measurement and local preferences.">
  <div class="article">
    <h1 class="page-heading">隐私说明<span lang="en">Privacy</span></h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p lang="zh-CN">网站由 Cloudflare 托管。启用 Cloudflare Web Analytics 时，浏览器会发送页面访问和性能指标，帮助我们了解哪些内容被阅读及页面加载表现。Cloudflare Web Analytics 不使用 Cookie 或访客指纹来衡量访问。</p>
      <p lang="en">Cloudflare hosts this website. When Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled, browsers send page activity and performance metrics to help us understand readership and page load performance. Cloudflare Web Analytics measures traffic without cookies or visitor fingerprinting.</p>
      <p lang="zh-CN">我们使用搜索引擎提供的汇总搜索表现数据。明暗主题偏好保存在当前浏览器的本地存储中。</p>
      <p lang="en">We use aggregate search performance data from search engines. Your light or dark theme preference is saved in this browser's local storage.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
